  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Apps\n* Bump `net_conduit_tcp` from `2.3.0` to `2.3.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_tcp/2.3.0...net_conduit_tcp/2.3.1)\n* Bump `net_conduit_websocket` from `2.3.0` to `2.3.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_websocket/2.3.0...net_conduit_websocket/2.3.1)\n* Bump `net_conduit_udp` from `2.3.0` to `2.3.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_udp/2.3.0...net_conduit_udp/2.3.1)\n* Bump `net_conduit_ipc` from `2.3.0` to `2.3.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_ipc/2.3.0...net_conduit_ipc/2.3.1)\n* Bump `net_conduit_quic` from `2.3.0` to `2.3.1`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_quic/2.3.0...net_conduit_quic/2.3.1)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump NukeBuildHelpers from 9.0.23 to 9.0.24 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/74\n* fix: event handler exception safety + non-happy-path tests by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/75\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20260506094410.c842428...build.20260507062105.61e6d12",
